---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Nav from "../components/nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/footer.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/7.0.1/css/all.min.css"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
    />
    <title>About Me | Patrick's Website</title>
  </head>
  <body class="scroll-smooth">
    <Nav />
    <main id="about">
      <section class="about-section">
        <div class="about-text">
          <h2>About Me</h2>
          <p>
            Hey, I'm Patrick! I’ve loved technology from a very young age,
            starting with the family Windows XP computer. My early interest led
            me to take tech classes in high school, earning Microsoft
            certifications in Networking Fundamentals and Security Fundamentals.
            During my senior year, a Java class completely changed my
            perspective and solidified my passion for software development.
          </p>
          <p>
            My favorite work lies at the intersection of design and development,
            where I create experiences that not only look great but are
            carefully crafted for performance and usability. I’m passionate
            about building accessible, well-designed projects that blends
            pixel-perfect design with robust engineering.
          </p>
          <p>
            I’m currently working as a freelance full-stack developer,
            designing, building, and refining web applications with a strong
            focus on accessibility, performance, and usability. My goal is to
            deliver software that not only runs perfectly but also provides a
            satisfying and well-designed experience for every user.
          </p>
          <p>
            Previously, I’ve developed software for start-ups and freelance
            clients, collaborating closely with small teams to transform
            innovative ideas into reality. Beyond coding, I enjoy exploring new
            technologies and continuously improving my skills to deliver the
            best possible results.
          </p>
          <p>
            Outside of work, I enjoy gaming, working on personal tech projects,
            and staying active in various communities. Engaging with others
            allows me to build meaningful connections, share ideas, and
            continuously learn from different perspectives in both tech and
            gaming.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-image">
          <img src="/src/assets/profile2.png" alt="profile" />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2>Resume PDF</h2>
        <p>A shortened PDF version of my resume can be downloaded below ↓</p>
        <div class="resume-button">
          <a href="your-resume.pdf" target="_blank" class="btn">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Download Resume
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
  <Footer />
</html>
